            "review_title": "Review at The Yacht Bbq Buffet",
            "review_text": "Steven G\n2 contributions\n0\nFantabulous! If it is even a word.\nApr 2025 • Friends\nWe were blown away, not just by the restaurant setting, but the food and the amazing hospitality accorded. Alice and her colleagues made us felt special with personable services. Kudos.\nInsider tip:\nHave the lovely people there recommend. Cannot go wrong.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 8, 2025\nHảo Trâm\nDear stevengN6230IK\nWe are incredibly grateful that you took the time to share your wonderful experience at Ambassador Club, Ana Marina Nha Trang! Reading your 5-star review filled with positive feedback is a tremendous source of encouragement for our entire team. We are so delighted to know that you enjoyed a delicious meal and were satisfied with the quality of our food, the restaurant's ambiance, and the attentive service provided by our staff.\nYour satisfaction is always our top priority at Ambassador Club, Ana Marina Nha Trang. We continuously strive to provide the best culinary experiences and service to all our customers. Your compliments serve as motivation for us to keep improving and perfecting ourselves in the future.\nWe truly appreciate your trust and support for Ambassador Club, Ana Marina Nha Trang. We hope to have the opportunity to welcome you and your family and friends back soon to continue providing you with memorable dining moments. Please don't hesitate to recommend Ambassador Club, Ana Marina Nha Trang to your loved ones!\nOnce again, thank you sincerely, and we look forward to seeing you again!\nBest regards,\nHarry Tran ( Mr. )\nRestaurant Manager, Ambassador Club, Ana Marina Nha Trang\nRead more\nWritten April 10, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
